{"title":"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square\" title=\"Square\">square</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb57e91641d0e85ff31a3e4f96eaf4345ca5b27b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE=EF=FD=30$\" width=\"178\" height=\"12\" />. Find the area of the square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Drawing the square and examining the given lengths,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/e/97e1902d72e5ce4625cf85ddc9e4d4562650ec51.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(2inch, 2inch); currentpen = fontsize(8pt); pair A = (0, 0); dot(A); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, plain.SW); pair B = (3, 0); dot(B); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, plain.SE); pair C = (3, 3); dot(C); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, plain.NE); pair D = (0, 3); dot(D); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, plain.NW); pair E = (0, 1); dot(E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, plain.W); pair F = (3, 2); dot(F); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, plain.E); label(&quot;$\\frac x3$&quot;, E--A); label(&quot;$\\frac x3$&quot;, F--C); label(&quot;$x$&quot;, A--B); label(&quot;$x$&quot;, C--D); label(&quot;$\\frac {2x}3$&quot;, B--F); label(&quot;$\\frac {2x}3$&quot;, D--E); label(&quot;$30$&quot;, B--E); label(&quot;$30$&quot;, F--E); label(&quot;$30$&quot;, F--D); draw(B--C--D--F--E--B--A--D); [/asy]\" width=\"242\" height=\"225\" />\nyou find that the three segments cut the square into three equal horizontal sections. Therefore, (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> being the side length), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872f23417b3480f75ced652e9aefe2db36aba261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x^2+(x/3)^2}=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"149\" height=\"32\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/c/0bcf7c6f914e610eeb23863d08a0912e6163a0af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+(x/3)^2=900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"19\" />. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and simplifying, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/c/a3c4d4199954d691072f48f27609ae6ba738d50e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10x^2=8100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />. Dividing by ten gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e6b694e54dcbc29e23c89d91f1589297fe011eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=810.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Area of the square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80ded0ad14d8258724cd215cca1b6ba65d2683e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{810}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"38\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Drop horizontal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, called lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01a41c052eb0a44a2290b0bf7a9949aafd23ecf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l, m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> respectively. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is a reflection upon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" />, which is a reflection upon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />. Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> to intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and apply with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. Understand that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af795073efa0f5c5d39641d8f4137fa36a0ffc6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABGE, GEFH, HFCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" /> are all with diagonal 30. Then, the three rectangles are simply reflected over their side lengths, which then form the area of the square, so each of the rectangles share <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> the area of the square. Due to their trisections, their sides also trisect the square (exception of the longer side), so let that be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a78b1906e324b813c404f54a148cd0217702c51b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a^2 = 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433481d2302bd3dcc701e3fccead679a4dff3cd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\sqrt{90}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"21\" />. We require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9a2c85b581b8f1f1a36de12bd674e9ab94b6bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a^2 = 9 \\cdot 90 = \\boxed{810}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"155\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II\" title=\"2011 AIME II\">2011 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2011 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017142429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 254/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6811/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.509      1 -total\n 61.85%    8.355      1 Template:AIME_box\n 36.38%    4.915      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9203:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017142429 and revision id 285057. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}